   agree    5 row(s) | last_name=Text(Ada) reason=Text(checkup) | last_name=Text(Ada) reason=Text(follow up) | last_name=Text(Bob) reason=Text(checkup) | last_name=Text(Ada) reason=Text(checkup) | last_name=Text(Cy) reason=Null
